/target

# Secrets and local configuration
.env
.claude/settings.local.json
CLAUDE.local.md

# Real receipts never enter git, even redacted: the repository may become public.
/tests/fixtures/local/
*.mbox
*.eml

# Python bytecode from the docs checker and its tests
__pycache__/

# Database dumps are treated like the database: the mount point stays, its contents never enter git.
/backups/*
!/backups/.gitkeep
*.dump
*.sql.gz

# The page of `qm due --html` holds your purchase history; it never enters git (ADR 0012).
/*.html

# The Gmail refresh token of `qm fetch` (ADR 0013). Its place is the state directory.
gmail-token.json*

# A snapshot that a failed test leaves beside the committed one. Read it, then delete it; the
# committed snapshot is written by the command that docs/reference/files.md names.
*.snap.new

# What `cargo fuzz` writes: its build, the inputs that a run finds, and the input of a failure.
# The committed seeds are in fuzz/seeds/.
/fuzz/target/
/fuzz/corpus/
/fuzz/artifacts/
/fuzz/coverage/
# The result of a run of cargo mutants (docs/runbooks/develop.md).
/mutants.out/
/mutants.out.old/
